 and killed his family by accident when he was 18 and since then he has been in a state of confusion and remorse. But he doesn't want to die, he sees death as an irresponsible escape.He used to be a very righteous and cheerful man.\nHe now sees himself as a weapon and no longer sees himself as a free man.He is afraid of strong winds.\n\nモチーフ：逆さ男（REVERSE），正義（SEIGI）、犠牲（GISEI）", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}